WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.130
Welcome to Workforce Empowerment. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Enable the workforce to achieve goals through capacity, roles and support.

2
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:20.670
Consider this scenario. A critical service depends on one person with no trained backup. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:32.040
Start with two steps: Identify roles and required capabilities. Then Provide support and decision authority. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:41.470
Continue with Build resilience through backups. Then Review workload and competence. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:41.470 --> 00:01:01.950
Stronger evidence looks like this: Stronger: contemporaneous skill matrix, delegation record, succession plan tied to real work. Weaker evidence would be: Weaker: assigning roles without checking actual ability and coverage; no trace of consistent use. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:16.200
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
